        "concept": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Name</h3><p>Our name comes from the Shona word <em>kupenya</em> — to shine, to glow, to be polished. But Penya was never built around a single glow. It was built to amplify many. We are a collective: a curated stage for designers across Africa and its diaspora, each with a distinct voice, a rooted story, and something the world needs to see.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
