        "vision": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Mission</h3><p>Africa has always produced extraordinary designers. What it has not always had is the infrastructure to make them fully visible. That is the gap Penya exists to close. We do not dictate an aesthetic — we build a platform. We provide the stage, the curation, and the reach. The designers bring everything else.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "",
